# Xcode
**/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcuserstate
DerivedData/
build/

# Swift Package Manager
.build/
**/.swiftpm/
Packages/*/.build/
Packages/*/.swiftpm/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Generated coverage / logs
*.xcresult
*.log

